            <title>[LU-20094] Buffer overflow detected when reading YAML file using old API</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20094</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;lnetctl import could lead to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="preformattedContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;*** buffer overflow detected ***: terminated
Aborted (core dumped) &lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The buffer used when reading YAML file with fgets in old API is 1 byte too small: we need to store '\0'.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Also wrong length is given to fgets because strlen is called on modified buffer instead of the old one.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
